{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Mathlib.SchenstedWordRecovery","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Mathlib.SchenstedWordRecovery","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Mathlib.SchenstedReverseCascade"],"declarations":9,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.Schensted.word_eq_of_insertWord_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.Schensted.word_eq_of_insertWord_eq","kind":"theorem","line":99,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SchenstedWordRecovery.lean#L99-L108","doc":"**The `P` side of RSK is injective, given the index list.** Two words with the same insertion\ntableau *and* the same row-index record are equal.\n\nThis is the shape brick 4 will discharge: the recording tableau determines `rowIndices`, so equal\n`(P, Q)` pairs force equal words. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.Schensted.uninsertSteps_insertWord","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.Schensted.uninsertSteps_insertWord","kind":"theorem","line":93,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SchenstedWordRecovery.lean#L93-L97","doc":"**Word recovery from the empty tableau** — the form the RSK inverse consumes:\n`insertWord w` together with `rowIndices [] w` determines `w`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.Schensted.uninsertSteps_foldl","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.Schensted.uninsertSteps_foldl","kind":"theorem","line":77,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SchenstedWordRecovery.lean#L77-L91","doc":"**The word-recovery law.** Running the insertions of `w` into a well-formed `T` and then\nundoing them at their recorded rows returns `T` and `w` exactly.\n\nThe induction is the mirror of `insertWord`'s fold: the outer step of `w` is undone *last*, which\nis where `uninsertSteps`' order pays off — the inductive hypothesis applies to the inner fold\nunchanged, and brick 2's `uninsert_insert` closes the outer step. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.Schensted.uninsertSteps_cons","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.Schensted.uninsertSteps_cons","kind":"theorem","line":69,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SchenstedWordRecovery.lean#L69-L75","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.Schensted.uninsertSteps_nil","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.Schensted.uninsertSteps_nil","kind":"theorem","line":67,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SchenstedWordRecovery.lean#L67-L67","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.Schensted.uninsertSteps","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.Schensted.uninsertSteps","kind":"def","line":52,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SchenstedWordRecovery.lean#L52-L65","doc":"**Undo a run of insertions.** `uninsertSteps T is` treats `T` as the tableau *after* all the\nsteps recorded in `is` (in insertion order) and peels them off, returning the starting tableau and\nthe recovered word.\n\nNote the order: `i :: rest` undoes `rest` — the *later* steps — before `i`. That is what keeps this\na structural recursion on the forward list. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.Schensted.rowIndices_cons","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.Schensted.rowIndices_cons","kind":"theorem","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SchenstedWordRecovery.lean#L49-L50","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.Schensted.rowIndices_nil","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.Schensted.rowIndices_nil","kind":"theorem","line":47,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SchenstedWordRecovery.lean#L47-L47","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.Schensted.rowIndices","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.Schensted.rowIndices","kind":"def","line":41,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SchenstedWordRecovery.lean#L41-L45","doc":"**The row-index record.** For each letter of `w`, the row where its insertion appended the new\ncell — computed along the same fold `insertWord` performs. ","signatureChunk":0}]}